      "value": "<p><em>Armor (Any Light, Medium, or Heavy), Rarity Varies (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>Bound into this armor is a spell of level 8 or lower. The spell is determined when the armor is created and must belong to the Abjuration or Illusion school of magic. The armor has 6 charges and regains 1d6 expended charges daily at dawn. While wearing the armor, you can expend 1 charge to cast its spell.</p><p>The level of the spell bound into the armor determines the spell’s saving throw DC and attack bonus, as well as the armor’s rarity, as shown in the following table.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Spell Level</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Save DC</th><th>Attack Bonus</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cantrip</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>13</td><td>+5</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>13</td><td>+5</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Rare</td><td>13</td><td>+5</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Rare</td><td>15</td><td>+7</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Very Rare</td><td>15</td><td>+7</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Very Rare</td><td>17</td><td>+9</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Legendary</td><td>17</td><td>+9</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Legendary</td><td>18</td><td>+10</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Legendary</td><td>18</td><td>+10</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-EnspelledArmor01\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Choisissez l’enchantement du niveau du sort lié : il règle le DD et le bonus d’attaque et ajoute à l’équipement une activité <em>Cast</em> avec ses 6 charges. Déposez ensuite le sort (Abjuration ou Illusion) sur cette activité.</p></section><p>@Embed[Compendium.dnd5e.content24.JournalEntry.dmgFoundryRefere.JournalEntryPage.Ok4iCgD25ENgoRxE cite=false caption=false classes=\"hide-in-embed\"]</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
